.TH "GF-ANNOTATIONS-POST-GRAPHITE-ANNOTATION" "1" "Jun 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-annotations-post-graphite-annotation - Creates annotation in graphite format


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf annotations post-graphite-annotation [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates annotation in graphite format

.PP
Creates an annotation by using Graphite-compatible event format. The \fBwhen\fR and \fBdata\fR fields are optional. If \fBwhen\fR is not specified then the current time will be used as annotation’s timestamp. The \fBtags\fR field can also be in prior to Graphite \fB0.10.0\fR format (string with multiple tags being separated by a space).

.PP
Body schema (PostGraphiteAnnotationsCmd):
  data  string
  tags  object
  what  string
  when  number

.PP
Response schema (PostGraphiteAnnotationOK.Payload):
  id       number  REQUIRED
                   ID Identifier of the created annotation.
  message  string  REQUIRED
                   Message Message of the created annotation.


